local notation "Src"=>MixedPastTerminalSources.source 𝓕 μ H Λ κ hκ haU haV hell hbU hbV I₀ I₁ u₀ v₀ S P haP v b hvb Z htarget hstop F hF hFm

theorem source_nonneg (k:ℕ) (choices:List (Fin k×Fin (k+1))) (ν χ:ℝ) (hν:0≤ν)
    (i:Fin (k+1)) (h:History X k) (ω:Ω):0≤Src k choices ν χ i h ω:=by
  unfold MixedPastTerminalSources.source
  refine Fin.cases ?_ (fun j=>?_) i
  · simp only [PairedAssignedTelescope.sources,Fin.cases_zero]
    exact Real.rpow_nonneg (le_min (by norm_num) (by positivity)) _
  · simp only [PairedAssignedTelescope.sources,Fin.cases_succ,PairedRoughWordMoments.source]
    split_ifs
    · exact NormalizedPairedLeaf.source_nonneg P.holder_nonneg _ _ _ _ _ _
    · exact Real.rpow_nonneg (abs_nonneg _) _

